- * int 2e instead of entering the Prospero kernel. */
+/* The file has call [0x7ffe1000]. ps5-forever-wine ee64b784 compiles
+ * call [0x7ffe4000] instead, and never installs int 2e. Rewrite that
+ * immediate when the dispatcher page was mapped. A Win10 tail left by an
+ * older image is put back on the call. 0f 05 stays, and SystemCall stays
+ * 1, so jne +3 does not enter the Prospero kernel. A failed map leaves
+ * call [0x7ffe1000], which is the path Mihawk already booted. */
